      "created_at": "2015-03-24T13:45:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Medic-Tank\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/medic-tank/48/2107_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Medic-Tank:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If you want to ensure that you receive preorder items as soon as they are released and do not mind paying extra shipping, you can place multiple orders, each containing different preorder items. For anyone interested in doing so, the items available through this preorder will be shipped in three “batches”, which are, not necessarily in chronological order:if I lean on this line timing was NEVER clearly defined as long as the preorder was live…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I believe that's correct. If timing was ever specified beyond which items would be batched together, I missed it or have forgotten it.</p>",
