      "created_at": "2015-03-24T17:42:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There was only a minor update from the preorder campaign and it didn't give much of a timeframe</p><blockquote><div>Sentinel Tactics: The Flame of Freedom Kickstarter Backers</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Some of these preorder items may be things that you are already expecting as a result of backing Sentinel Tactics: The Flame of Freedom, such as the Minions miniatures or the scenario maps. If your pledge included either of those items, you will be getting yours first, as soon as we get them. No need to preorder them here.</div></blockquote>",
